{"unit_id": "linxuhao__Deepseek-Continuity#feature-1", "repo": "linxuhao/Deepseek-Continuity", "commit": "35c4ad2461819de4147eeaa86aa64d0dc4f0656e", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-plugin-continuity 的功能「subject_image」：可先创建角色、动物或道具主体，再按场景描述生成沿用该主体参考的图像；调用者提供主体名和场景，结果保存为图像文件。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["src/continuity_mcp/server.py:362", "src/continuity_mcp/server.py:473"]}
